{"assets":["/statement-assets/2dff52d5da3c12cc701cbb3ae7d6f0ae1201d53aff142db2899609e76b95731d.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"895","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Eyes Closed"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2.5 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Vasya and Petya were tired of studying so they decided to play a game. Before the game begins Vasya looks at array "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" consisting of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers. As soon as he remembers all elements of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" the game begins. Vasya closes his eyes and Petya does "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" actions of one of two types:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1)"},{"kind":"text","text":" Petya says 4 integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"l1, r1, l2, r2"},{"kind":"text","text":" — boundaries of two non-intersecting segments. After that he swaps one random element from the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"[l1, r1]"},{"kind":"text","text":" segment with another random element from the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"[l2, r2]"},{"kind":"text","text":" segment."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2)"},{"kind":"text","text":" Petya asks Vasya the sum of the elements of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" in the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"[l, r]"},{"kind":"text","text":" segment."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Vasya is a mathematician so he answers Petya the mathematical expectation of the sum of the elements in the segment."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to write a program which will answer the second type questions as Vasya would do it. In other words your program should print the mathematical expectation of the sum of the elements of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" in the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"[l, r]"},{"kind":"text","text":" segment for every second type query."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n, q"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2 ≤ n ≤ 105, 1 ≤ q ≤ 105"},{"kind":"text","text":")  — the number of elements in the array and the number of queries you need to handle."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ai ≤ 109"},{"kind":"text","text":")  — elements of the array."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain Petya's actions of type 1 or 2."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If it is a type "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" action then the line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"5"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1, l1, r1, l2, r2"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ l1 ≤ r1 ≤ n, 1 ≤ l2 ≤ r2 ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If it is a type "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":" query then the line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2, l, r"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ l ≤ r ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that there is at least one type "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":" query and segments "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"[l1, r1], [l2, r2]"},{"kind":"text","text":" don't have common elements. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each type "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":" query print one real number — the mathematical expectation of the sum of elements in the segment."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your answer will be considered correct if its absolute or relative error doesn't exceed "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"10 - 4"},{"kind":"text","text":"  — formally, the answer is correct if "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/2dff52d5da3c12cc701cbb3ae7d6f0ae1201d53aff142db2899609e76b95731d.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" where "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" is jury's answer and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y"},{"kind":"text","text":" is yours."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"